Package: koko-widget
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libgtk4-layer-shell0
Description: Native Liquid Glass floating widget overlay
 A floating, always-available widget layer for the Linux desktop. It shows
 the currently playing track from any MPRIS-compliant player, the time, the
 date and any text you want, each as an independent glass pill that can be
 moved, resized and restyled.
 .
 Written in Rust with GTK4 and Cairo. No Electron, no Tauri, no WebView.
 Layer-shell compositors get anchored surfaces; X11 uses EWMH dock windows.
